 *   os.sendfile                 util.py:2200 (sendfile_kern, in_fd argument 1)
 *   os.scandir                  util.py:2237 (statdir, the listing read behind VFS.ls/walk/zipgen)
 *   bos/os stat|lstat|unlink|rmdir|rename|mkdir|makedirs   request-serving files (fs_stat/fs_unlink/fs_rename/fs_mkdir families)
 *   bos.path/os.path existence probes (path_check family)  weak metadata sinks, kept per the approved labels (conf 0.55-0.6)
 *
 * Sink entries classified `candidate` (24: thumbnail/media pipelines,
 * broker-IPC-fed opens, untraced hashlist param) are deliberately NOT
 * modeled here - they were the manual-review points of the Phase 1
 * review (section 7) and are documented in
 * report/query_generation_notes.md. os.path.join / normpath / dirname
 * etc. are propagation steps (summary labels), not sinks.
